        "type": "nodetool.workflows.base_node.Comment",
        "data": {
          "comment": "# Chapter Markers for a Long Recording\n\nProposes chapter titles for a long recording so listeners can jump between topics. You review the suggested boundaries and keep the ones that fit.\n\n**How it works:** \"1 Recording\" takes a video file. \"2 Extract audio\" pulls the soundtrack, and \"3 Transcribe\" converts it to English text. \"4 Agent\" lists each chapter as a short title with the opening words of its section. \"5 Output\" shows the list.\n\n**Try this:** Pick models for \"3 Transcribe\" and \"4 Agent\", and ask the Agent in its system prompt for no more than eight chapters."
        },
